    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. \"choosing meaning\" just feels like another chore on a list that never ends. like i'm just decorating a room in a house that's eventually going to be burned down anyway. it feels exhausting to keep performing this \"existence\" thing when the math just doesn't add up. why do we even bother fighting so hard to stay in a game that has no prize at the end?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
